            </note>
            <note corresp="#ch_d3-f4" n="4" xml:id="ch_d3-f4-content">
                <p>On April 16, 1958, President Ibáñez telegraphed President Eisenhower directly and
                    cancelled his visit, citing domestic developments as the reason for
                    cancellation. (725.11/4–1653)</p>
            </note>
